# Title: Process Creation Using Sysnative Folder
# ID: 3c1b5fb0-c72f-45ba-abd1-4d4c353144ab
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Max Altgelt (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-23
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.stealth, attack.t1055
# Description: Detects process creation events that use the Sysnative folder (common for CobaltStrike spawns)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*:\\Windows\\Sysnative\\*) OR (process_name:*:\\Windows\\Sysnative\\*)) AND -(((process_name:*C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\Framework64\\v* OR process_name:*C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\Framework\\v* OR process_name:*C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\FrameworkArm\\v* OR process_name:*C:\\Windows\\Microsoft.NET\\FrameworkArm64\\v*) AND process_name:*\\ngen.exe AND cmdline:*install*)) AND -(((cmdline:*\"C:\\Windows\\sysnative\\cmd.exe\"* AND cmdline:*\\xampp\\* AND cmdline:*\\catalina_start.bat*))))
